&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-facing:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;30% working directly with customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coding &amp;amp; Integration: 70-80% hands-on technical implementation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
