&lt;p&gt;Messages is foundational infrastructure. Every product team at DevRev depends on the patterns you establish here. You&#39;ll define how conversations begin, evolve, interrupt, resume, and resolve - across threads, channels, real-time exchanges, and async flows. This isn&#39;t feature work; it&#39;s the connective tissue of the entire platform.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
