&lt;li&gt;Define interaction patterns for human-to-human, human-to-Computer, and Computer-initiated communication that feel native to each context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make hard trade-offs between information density, interruptibility, and conversational flow - and articulate what you sacrificed and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design for progressive disclosure and graceful complexity: messages carry metadata, context, actions, and links to the knowledge graph without overwhelming the reader.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with engineering on the technical constraints of real-time systems - latency, optimistic UI, delivery states, and platform adaptation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Arcade (our design system) at the pattern level - your messaging components become the reference implementation other teams build on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor L1-L3 designers with enough structure that they grow visibly; give feedback that demonstrably improves work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
