&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-8 years of product design experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level proficiency with Figma and prototyping tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of conversational interfaces, messaging systems, or real-time collaboration products.&lt;/li&gt;
